    },
    {
      "id": "2012-r1-phys-6",
      "number": "I-F 问6",
      "topic": "完全非弹性碰撞后的摆升高度",
      "topicTag": "力学·动量与能量",
      "questionType": "choice",
      "humanVerified": true,
      "answer_match": true,
      "needs_review": false,
      "japanese": "质量 $M$ 的物体 A 用两根等长细绳悬挂静止。质量 $m$ 的黏土小球 B 以水平速度 $v$ 飞来并瞬间粘在 A 上。之后 A、B 一体运动，最高点比初始位置升高 $h$，求 $h$。",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "①",
          "content": "$\\dfrac{m}{2(M+m)g}v^2$"
        },
        {
          "label": "②",
          "content": "$\\dfrac{m^2}{2(M+m)^2g}v^2$"
        },
        {
          "label": "③",
          "content": "$\\dfrac{v^2}{2g}$"
        },
        {
          "label": "④",
          "content": "$\\dfrac{M}{2(M+m)g}v^2$"
        },
        {
          "label": "⑤",
          "content": "$\\dfrac{M^2}{2(M+m)^2g}v^2$"
        }
      ],
      "questionImage": "/images/2012_R1_physics/q06.png",
      "solution": {
        "translation": "碰撞瞬间只用水平方向动量守恒；碰后上升过程用机械能守恒。",
        "analysis": "小球粘住 A 是完全非弹性碰撞，碰撞中机械能不守恒。碰撞后的一体速度再全部转化为重力势能。",
        "steps": [
          {
            "title": "(1) 碰后速度",
            "content": "$$mv=(M+m)u$$\n\n$$u=\\frac{m}{M+m}v$$"
          },
          {
            "title": "(2) 上升到最高点",
            "content": "$$\\frac12(M+m)u^2=(M+m)gh$$\n\n$$h=\\frac{u^2}{2g}=\\frac{m^2}{2(M+m)^2g}v^2$$"
          }
        ],
        "finalAnswer": "② $\\dfrac{m^2}{2(M+m)^2g}v^2$",
        "correctOption": "②"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2012-r1-phys-7",
      "number": "I-G 问7",
      "topic": "考虑重力随高度变化的竖直上抛",
      "topicTag": "力学·万有引力与能量",
      "questionType": "choice",
      "humanVerified": true,
      "answer_match": true,
      "needs_review": false,
      "japanese": "从地表以速度 $v_0$ 竖直向上抛出物体，最高到达离地表高度 $h$。地球半径为 $R$，地表重力加速度为 $g$，忽略自转影响，求 $h$。",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "①",
          "content": "$\\dfrac{v_0^2R}{gR+v_0^2}$"
        },
        {
          "label": "②",
          "content": "$\\dfrac{v_0^2R}{gR-v_0^2}$"
        },
        {
          "label": "③",
          "content": "$\\dfrac{v_0^2R}{2gR+v_0^2}$"
        },
        {
          "label": "④",
          "content": "$\\dfrac{v_0^2R}{2gR-v_0^2}$"
        },
        {
          "label": "⑤",
          "content": "$\\dfrac{2v_0^2R}{2gR+v_0^2}$"
        },
        {
          "label": "⑥",
          "content": "$\\dfrac{2v_0^2R}{2gR-v_0^2}$"
        }
      ],
      "questionImage": "/images/2012_R1_physics/q07.png",
      "solution": {
        "translation": "高度不一定很小时，应使用万有引力势能差，而不是直接用 $mgh$。",
        "analysis": "地表 $g=GM/R^2$，从 $R$ 到 $R+h$ 的势能增加为 $GMm(1/R-1/(R+h))$。",
        "steps": [
          {
            "title": "列能量守恒",
            "content": "$$\\frac12mv_0^2=GMm\\left(\\frac1R-\\frac1{R+h}\\right)$$\n\n用 $GM=gR^2$：\n\n$$\\frac12v_0^2=\\frac{gRh}{R+h}$$"
          },
          {
            "title": "解出 $h$",
            "content": "$$v_0^2(R+h)=2gRh$$\n\n$$h=\\frac{v_0^2R}{2gR-v_0^2}$$"
          }
        ],
        "finalAnswer": "④ $\\dfrac{v_0^2R}{2gR-v_0^2}$",
        "correctOption": "④"
      }
    },
